  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fa5db35ac5d81d49b0eff06f993ad07, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ask for the potions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  paragraphs:
  - paragraph: '"I see I''ve caught your interest," giggles the wizard proudly. "I
      can offer you two potions." The wizard pulls out two small vessels from under
      his coat. One flickers in fiery red. "Here we have a potion of strength, one
      that will make you as powerful as ten men." The other one shines in ocean blue.
      "And here, a potion to ward off evil spirits, ensuring your safety on dark
      and treacherous nights."'
